  (text "CPLD (ATF1504AS) functions\n  CLK14 14.7456 MHz in.  PHI2 = CLK14/2 = 7.3728 MHz, stretched for\n  $C000-$CFFF I/O cycles (SCC, VDP, TIM-Bus cards).  PCLK = CLK14/2,\n  never stretched (exact baud rates).\n  Bank latch: BA0-BA3 from CD0-CD3 while PHI2 is low.  Banks $00-$07 RAM,\n  $08-$0F flash; A16-A18 = BA0-BA2 (all ones in the bank 0 boot window).\n  RD/WR: PHI2-qualified strobes for memory and SCC.\n  BUF_OE: low while PHI2 is high.  Chip selects gated by VDA|VPA.\n  IO_C0: $C000-$C0FF; 74HC138 splits $C000-$C07F by A4-A6:\n    $C000 VIA, $C010 SCC, $C020 VDP, $C030 spare (IO_SP3).\n  DEVSEL $C080-$C0FF, IOSEL $C100-$C7FF, IOSTRB $C800-$CFFF.\nInterrupts: VIA (W65C22N), SCC and TIM-Bus are all open-drain on IRQB.\nAll 32 CPLD I/O pins are now used." (at 25.4 211.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid f9410870-cd04-4e48-a29f-ae8ab7485ade)
  )
